=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# logs screen-elsewhere ----------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Mock: the Logs screen. web-01.example.net runs Debian 13, less$
# installed. hardn.yml says logFile: /srv/log/hardn.log, where$
# nothing writes. The screen reads the file hardn writes and$
# says so; origin/main reads logFile, not what main() opens (P-$
# 18; config.go:324).$
$
# Logs #########################################################$
$
# Log ----------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  File                 /var/log/hardn.log$
   -  Size                 410 bytes, 8 lines$
   -  hardn.yml's logFile says /srv/log/hardn.log. hardn doesn't$
      write there.$
$
# Last 3 of 8 lines --------------------------------------------$
$
   -  2026/10/20 12:00:03 INSTALLED: Package ufw$
   -  2026/10/20 12:00:04 WARNING: ufw is not active$
   -  2026/10/20 12:00:05 ERROR: Failed to configure firewall:$
      exit status 1$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Open                 The whole log in less$
   2) Refresh              Read the log again$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter selection [0-2 or q]:$
$
$

